%% Reference: docs/DECISION_SPEC.md §2.3/§4.2 — Jev only handles choice/noul decisions and never generates natural language; threshold is 0.85.
flowchart TB
    Q["Uncertain questions<br/>rules can't decide"] --> J["Jev: structured decision<br/>choice / noul + confidence"]
    Q --> T["Text LLM: open-ended fallback<br/>extraction gap-filling / classification chain"]
    J --> C["≥0.85 accepted<br/>below 0.85 goes to the manual queue"]
    T --> U["Only tries providers with a configured key<br/>tries each in turn until one succeeds"]
